<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for taking the time to contact us. I was concerned to learn of your experience at {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If charged correctly by QF use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a full service airline, we include a certain amount of free baggage for each customer, within the fare paid. To keep airfares competitive, we charge appropriately for baggage that is in excess of the allowance provided.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">While we are unable to meet your request for a refund, we appreciate you taking the time to let us know your experience. I would like to assure you that your feedback has been forwarded to our airport management for future reviews of our policies.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-Excess Baggage - Paid on Partner use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can understand your disappointment when you were asked to pay excess baggage charges on your flights with {!Case.Airline__c}. Qantas and {!Case.Airline__c} are two separate companies and offer their own individual range of policies and services. This is why our website advises ‘For travel on other airlines, check the baggage allowances with the applicable carrier before you travel’.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret that you were not aware of the baggage limit and were upset at having to pay for the extra baggage. If you believe that this amount was charged incorrectly, you will need to contact {!Case.Airline__c} directly.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-Excess Baggage - Paid on Codeshare use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can understand your disappointment when you were asked to pay excess baggage charges on your {!Case.Airline__c} operated flight. While airlines always try to accommodate our customers’ needs, there is a limited amount of baggage and freight that can be carried on each flight. Although Qantas and {!Case.Airline__c} do offer flights in partnership, we are two separate companies and offer our own individual range of products and services.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Our allowances for Qantas Frequent Flyers do not apply to services operated by carriers other than Qantas, QantasLink and Emirates. I regret you misunderstood this, however {!Case.Airline__c} were right to charge you, if you were over their baggage allowance.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-If error in charge by QF use:-</font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can understand your disappointment when you were asked to pay excess baggage charges on your flight to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}. I have investigated this matter and can confirm the fee was applied incorrectly. Please accept my sincere apologies for the error, on behalf of Qantas.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If refunding fee add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have arranged {!Case.Recovery_Value__c} and this should reflect in the card used as payment in the next 7 business days.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you again for taking the time to contact us. I hope we have the opportunity to welcome you on board soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>